Package: paparazzi
Title: Pipeable Browser Automation with 'chromote'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Garrick", "Aden-Buie", , "garrick@adenbuie.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7111-0077"))
Description: Drive web pages from R with a pipeable interface built on
    'chromote'. Find and interact with DOM elements, set input values, wait for
    page state, and assert on content and element state. Capture screenshots and
    record interactions as videos or GIFs, with optional cursor and typing
    animations for demos. Works with any page, including Shiny apps.
